    intro: "A plugin conflict interrupted checkout, and now every hosted platform looks simpler. First separate three choices: repair the current WooCommerce store, keep the website but replace its commerce layer, or migrate the whole storefront. Shopify fits a managed commerce-led rebuild, WooCommerce a store that needs its existing control, Wix a website-led business with supported commerce needs, and Ecwid an embedded store on an existing site. A lower subscription does not justify losing subscriptions, customer history or working URLs.",
